        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the clearly visible foreground child shown in <Picture 1>. Preserve the pictured child's face shape, eyes, nose, mouth, natural hairstyle, and childhood age. Only identity is referenced; replace the source outfit, props and background.\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The same referenced child gives a small natural smile while standing in a softly lit studio.\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - preserve the actual child's identity, age and natural hairstyle.\ndetailed_description:\nPhotorealistic live-action with a real child, natural skin and normal human proportions. [Shot 1] A steady head-and-shoulders frontal close-up shows the same child from <Picture 1>, wearing a simple pale blue cotton top in front of a plain warm gray studio backdrop. The whole head and both shoulders remain visible. Broad soft daylight illuminates the face evenly. At first the child looks gently toward the camera, then slowly makes a small genuine smile from 1 to 3 seconds, slightly blinks, and holds the smile until 5 seconds. The face and hair stay consistent throughout the continuous shot. No other people or props. No dialogue or written text.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor ambience with a subtle soft breath; no speech.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
